1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,903
Meet GLPfit, a weekly shot companion for Mounjaro and Wegovy users.

2
00:00:05,903 --> 00:00:09,635
Appetite and energy change across the week.

3
00:00:09,635 --> 00:00:15,972
GLPfit brings weight, shots, meals, and movement into one daily
routine.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,306
On shot day, Minji logs her injection and follows the suggested
site rotation.

5
00:00:24,306 --> 00:00:29,723
Her next shot, remaining pens, and clinic reminder update together.

6
00:00:29,723 --> 00:00:32,552
The curve uses the label half life.

7
00:00:32,552 --> 00:00:36,271
It is an estimate, not a measured blood level.

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:44,793
Symptoms are recorded by day after the injection, making weekly
patterns easier to discuss.

9
00:00:44,793 --> 00:00:49,123
Weight takes one number a day, keeping the routine simple.

10
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,932
Meals start with a photo.

11
00:00:52,932 --> 00:00:59,424
Muse Spark identifies foods and estimates protein and calories in
structured output.

12
00:00:59,424 --> 00:01:03,984
SAM 3.1 adds food instance counts and geometry.

13
00:01:03,984 --> 00:01:11,016
The app cross checks these signals, using vision estimates when
segmentation misses a food.

14
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,128
After the meal, a second photo estimates what was actually eaten.

15
00:01:18,128 --> 00:01:22,072
Here, some foods are finished while others remain.

16
00:01:22,072 --> 00:01:28,068
The estimated protein and calories flow into today's meal log
automatically.

17
00:01:28,068 --> 00:01:32,406
These are photo estimates, not laboratory measurements.

18
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,288
The exercise plan follows the shot cycle.

19
00:01:37,288 --> 00:01:41,058
Right after a shot, Minji sees gentle movement.

20
00:01:41,058 --> 00:01:44,106
Steadier days emphasize strength work.

21
00:01:44,106 --> 00:01:52,207
She checks off sets and adds stair climbing with her own duration
and sets, so the plan fits her day.

22
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:57,406
Minji asks what to eat when she feels queasy.

23
00:01:57,406 --> 00:02:05,506
The Muse Spark agent checks the app's tools for her schedule and
trends, then gives context aware guidance.

24
00:02:05,506 --> 00:02:11,258
Calculations stay on the server, and memory can preserve useful
preferences.

25
00:02:11,258 --> 00:02:16,481
The coach does not diagnose, prescribe, or recommend changing a
dose.

26
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,583
One tap prints thirty days of record tables without calling AI.

27
00:02:22,583 --> 00:02:28,112
The report groups dose history, weight, and symptoms by injection
cycle day.

28
00:02:28,112 --> 00:02:33,277
An optional AI summary adds a write up and questions for the
clinician.

29
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,993
English and Korean.

30
00:02:36,993 --> 00:02:40,874
Open source, with sample data to try.

31
00:02:40,874 --> 00:02:46,538
GLPfit: a clearer weekly routine, built with Meta AI.
